---
// Pricing: three tiers with the middle "Team" plan highlighted as most popular.
---

<section class="bg-bg py-20 sm:py-28">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl text-center">
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400">Pricing</p>
      <h2 class="mt-3 font-display text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-fg sm:text-5xl">Simple pricing that stays out of your way</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted">Start free with up to five people. Upgrade when your team grows, and cancel any time.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-16 grid items-start gap-6 lg:grid-cols-3">
      <div class="flex flex-col rounded-card border border-line bg-bg p-8">
        <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-fg">Starter</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">For small teams finding their rhythm.</p>
        <p class="mt-6 flex items-baseline gap-2">
          <span class="font-display text-5xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-fg">$0</span>
          <span class="text-sm text-muted">free forever</span>
        </p>
        <a href="/contact" class="mt-8 inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-button border border-line bg-bg px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-fg transition hover:border-brand-400 hover:text-brand-600 dark:hover:text-brand-400">Get started free</a>
        <ul class="mt-8 flex flex-col gap-3 border-t border-line pt-8 text-sm text-fg">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <svg class="mt-0.5 h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
            <span>Up to 5 people</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <svg class="mt-0.5 h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
            <span>3 active projects</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <svg class="mt-0.5 h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
            <span>Board, list and calendar views</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <svg class="mt-0.5 h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
            <span>Weekly digest email</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <svg class="mt-0.5 h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
            <span>30-day activity history</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="relative flex flex-col rounded-card border border-brand-500 bg-bg p-8 shadow-xl shadow-brand-500/10 ring-4 ring-brand-500/15">
        <p class="absolute -top-3.5 left-8 inline-flex rounded-button bg-brand-600 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-white">Most popular</p>
        <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-fg">Team</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">For teams that plan together every week.</p>
        <p class="mt-6 flex items-baseline gap-2">
          <span class="font-display text-5xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-fg">$12</span>
          <span class="text-sm text-muted">per person / month</span>
        </p>
        <a href="/contact" class="mt-8 inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-button bg-brand-600 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white shadow-sm transition hover:bg-brand-700">Start a 14-day trial</a>
